OL,3,GNEWSAGiant aubergine grower Maggie says
OL,4,Ashe 'never expected to win' at national
OL,5,Aveg competition
OL,6,
OL,7,FWinners have been announced in 33
OL,8,Fcategories at this year's National
OL,9,FGiant Vegetables Championship
OL,11,FMaggie Walters' prize-winning aubergine
OL,12,Fweighed in at 3.95kg. "I never expected
OL,13,Fto win," she tells the BBC, adding it's
OL,14,Fa "nice surprise"
OL,16,FA total of seven world records have
OL,17,Fbeen provisionally set, including for
OL,18,Fthe heaviest beetroot and sunflower
OL,19,Fhead
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
