OL,3,GNEWSAGiant aubergine grower Maggie says
OL,4,Ashe 'never expected to win' at national
OL,5,Aveg competition
OL,6,
OL,7,FCompetitor Graham Barratt claims the
OL,8,Frecord for the longest cucumber,
OL,9,Fdespite what he describes as "bonkers"
OL,10,Fweather this year
OL,12,FThe competition comes after the UK's
OL,13,Fhottest summer on record, with farmers
OL,14,Ftelling our reporter that a "brutal"
OL,15,Ffew months left them "feeling the
OL,16,Ffinancial pressure"
